# Files in this folder that must NOT be pushed to the Apps Script project.
#
# clasp push = updateContent, which REPLACES the project's entire remote file
# list. Anything not pushed here is DELETED from the live project. So this list
# must be exactly: [repo-only metadata] + [files that genuinely belong to a
# different project]. The live project's real file set is:
#   appsscript.json, Credentials.js, Version.gs, Parse Telegram ChatLogs.js
#
# HISTORY: "process_sales_telegram_logs.js" used to be listed here while the
# live remote file is named "Parse Telegram ChatLogs". The name mismatch meant
# a push could never ship the parser AND dropped it from HEAD (2026-08-21
# incident). The file is now correctly named to match the remote, so it must
# be pushed — never re-add it here under any name.

# Repo-tooling metadata, not an Apps Script file.
manifest.json

# Copy of a file that belongs to other projects (1duQFfTO… / 1wmgYPwf…), not this
# one. Pushing it would ADD a stray file to the live project.
telegram_webhook_listener.js
